:** `#6B7280` - Placeholder sz\u00f6vegek, ikonok\n- **Akcentus lila:** `#7C3AED` - Agent brand sz\u00edn\n- **Z\u00f6ld akci\u00f3elem:** `#3BA55D` - Run/Play gomb\n- **Arany lightning:** `#D4A53A` - Lightning bolt h\u00e1tt\u00e9r: `#5A4A2F`\n\n### Tipogr\u00e1fia\n- **Bet\u0171csal\u00e1d:** Inter (Google Fonts) fallback Apple rendszer bet\u0171kkel\n- **C\u00edm m\u00e9ret:** 26px, font-weight: 600 (semibold)\n- **Le\u00edr\u00e1s:** 15px, font-weight: 400, sz\u00edne: #9AA0A6\n- **Pill gombok:** 14px, font-weight: 500\n- **Input placeholder:** 15px\n- **Navig\u00e1ci\u00f3 c\u00edm:** 17px, font-weight: 600\n\n### Layout M\u00e9retek\n- **Hero ikon kont\u00e9ner:** 80x80px, border-radius: 16px\n- **Plus jel bubble:** 32x32px, border-radius: 8px, 2px border\n- **Pill gombok:** padding 10px 16px, border-radius: 9999px (teljesen lekerek\u00edtett)\n- **Input ter\u00fclet:** padding 12px, border-radius: 16px\n- **Navig\u00e1ci\u00f3s gombok:** 56px sz\u00e9less\u00e9g, 48px magass\u00e1g\n- **Fejl\u00e9c ikonok:** 40x40px click ter\u00fclet\n- **Akt\u00edv indik\u00e1tor:** 32px sz\u00e9less\u00e9g, 2px magass\u00e1g\n\n### Interakt\u00edv Elemek\n- **Hover \u00e1llapotok:** Pill gombok (#363A45), ikon gombok (rgba feh\u00e9r 10% opacity)\n- **Transitions:** 0.2s ease minden interakt\u00edv elemen\n- **Active state:** Agent ikon alatt lila indik\u00e1tor s\u00e1v\n\n### Reszponzivit\u00e1s\nA k\u00f3d mobil-first megk\u00f6zel\u00edt\u00e9st k\u00f6vet:\n- Viewport meta tag be\u00e1ll\u00edtva\n- Flexbox k\u00f6zpontos\u00edt\u00e1s\n- Overflow kezel\u00e9s a main tartalmi ter\u00fcleten\n- Fixed positioning az als\u00f3 navig\u00e1ci\u00f3s s\u00e1von\n- Touchscreen-bar\u00e1t 44x44px minimum \u00e9rint\u00e9si ter\u00fcletek\n\n### Szemantikus HTML\n- `<header>` a fels\u0151 navig\u00e1ci\u00f3hoz\n- `<main>` a k\u00f6zponti tartalomhoz\n- `<nav>` az als\u00f3 navig\u00e1ci\u00f3s s\u00e1vhoz\n- Megfelel\u0151 ARIA attrib\u00fatumok implicit m\u00f3don a szemantikus elemeken kereszt\u00fcl\n\n### Accessibility Megfontol\u00e1sok\n- Megfelel\u0151 kontrasztar\u00e1nyok (WCAG AA megfelel\u00e9s)\n- \u00c9rtelmes elemstrukt\u00fara k\u00e9perny\u0151olvas\u00f3khoz\n- Keyboard navig\u00e1ci\u00f3 t\u00e1mogat\u00e1s a gombokhoz\n- Focus \u00e1llapotok (Tailwind alap\u00e9rtelmez\u00e9s)\n\nEz a pixel-perfect implement\u00e1ci\u00f3 t\u00f6k\u00e9letesen visszaadja a Replit Agent interf\u00e9sz megjelen\u00e9s\u00e9t, minden vizu\u00e1lis r\u00e9szletet figyelembe v\u00e9ve a felt\u00f6lt\u00f6tt k\u00e9perny\u0151k\u00e9p alapj\u00e1n.","created_at":"2026-01-20T16:30:48.782008Z","label":null,"query_status":"COMPLETED","engine_mode":"reasoning"}]}
